Do not edit the dirty parent. Do not rebuild bin/ooda.

Logline: Bench of a file that fails check exits non-zero and never prints a successful run line.
Setup: Worktree `/home/jeryd/.grok/worktrees/ooda-bench`. Proof file `cli/cmd_more.oo` `run_ooda_bench`. Known bad fixture `bootstrap/corpus/check/fail/no_cap_now_ms.oo`. Dirty parent `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda` is read-only.
Beats:
  1. Read the check-then-run gate in run_ooda_bench.
